major problems of the world.

00:00:11.247 --> 00:00:12.590
So to help you on your path,

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.024
in today's video we're going
to talk about seven ways

00:00:15.024 --> 00:00:18.097
to manage negative people at work.

00:00:18.097 --> 00:00:19.724
And, as always guys, as
you're listening if you hear

00:00:19.724 --> 00:00:21.553
something that really resonates with you,

00:00:21.553 --> 00:00:23.202
please leave it down
in the Comments below.

00:00:23.202 --> 00:00:24.526
Put quotes around it so other people

00:00:24.526 --> 00:00:26.153
